
[TestRequireLinkSignal/invalid-0 - 1]
Diagnostic 1: requireLinkSignal (9:66 - 9:71)
Message: `signal` is the caller's signal only — it ignores this instance being closed.
Help: Use `super.linkSignal({ signal: signal })` instead.
   8 | class A extends Base {
   9 |   run({ signal }: { signal: AbortSignal }) { return fetch("x", { signal }); }
     |                                                                  ~~~~~~
  10 | }
